                <TextValueRun styleId="481213:17" text="The held pause, then the answer writes itself under the question, the only other text: THE LORD OUR RIGHTEOUSNESS. Hold the whole courtroom in the light; the music rises alone for about thirty seconds while the camera eases back to the city and the two figures sit together on a rooftop under the landing sky." name="brief" id="481213:20"/>
